        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 505919TA3NLFA26, Multi Finished Faceted Lever with Disk Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Retro Modern Faceted T-Bar Lever With Disk Rose is tri-finished for a truly unique end look. This retro leverset features a mattel black disk rose, an unlaquered brass T-Bar Stem, and a polished chrome Faceted Lever. The Multi Finished Faceted Lever with Disk Rosette is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick doors with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-TAFA-specifications.gif?v=1704354621\" width=\"600\" height=\"142\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Faceted Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Tri-Finish Faceted Door Lever with Round Disk Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Faceted T-Bar Leverset with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Finish: Polished Chrome</li>\r\n<li>Stem Finish: Unlacqured Brass</li>\r\n<li>Rose Finish: Matte Black</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-TAFA-specifications.pdf?v=1704262371\"><b>Emtek Faceted Lever Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Emtek Select Brass Lever is assembled to order—allowing the finishes to be custom designed. Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirement or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Retro Modern Faceted T-Bar Lever With Disk Rose",
                "description": "The Retro Modern Faceted T-Bar Lever With Disk Rose is tri-finished for a truly unique end look. This retro leverset features a mattel black disk rose, an unlaquered brass T-Bar Stem, and a polished chrome Faceted Lever. The Multi Finished Faceted Lever with Disk Rosette is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick doors with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
